Cuando esta fría (entre 5°C y 20°C) se despega con facilidad.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16024497193117__92cf025b-d380-4f61-b2ec-9108e7a424f0-1675270065a460700c-0","template--16024497193117__92cf025b-d380-4f61-b2ec-9108e7a424f0-1675270065a460700c-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Emoji_hot_and_cold2.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"b0a17910-7984-481b-9484-645bdd45506a":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16024497193117__b0a17910-7984-481b-9484-645bdd45506a-1675270065a460700c-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Único elemento","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16024497193117__b0a17910-7984-481b-9484-645bdd45506a-1675270065a460700c-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Utilizar el <strong>Padi<\/strong>, reemplaza la Laca, la cinta azul, los pegamentos, los aerosoles de impresión 3D, la cinta kapton y muchos artilugios más.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16024497193117__b0a17910-7984-481b-9484-645bdd45506a-1675270065a460700c-0","template--16024497193117__b0a17910-7984-481b-9484-645bdd45506a-1675270065a460700c-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/225_-_Ligera2.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"39a6a8b2-c285-440e-a2b9-6ff9f01941bc":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16024497193117__39a6a8b2-c285-440e-a2b9-6ff9f01941bc-1675270065a460700c-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Impresiones perfectas con filamentos de calidad","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16024497193117__39a6a8b2-c285-440e-a2b9-6ff9f01941bc-1675270065a460700c-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Se puede imprimir sobre los Padi filamentos de cualquier tipo ABS, PLA, TPU, NyLon, Madera, etc. y tendrás superfecies de contacto perfectamente hechas.<\/p><p>Y también imprime espectacular con filamento PLA de calidad como el nuestro, puedes revisar todas las<strong> <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.print3x.cl\/collections\/pla#CaracteristicasFilamentoPLA\" title=\"https:\/\/www.print3x.cl\/collections\/pla#CaracteristicasFilamentoPLA\"><strong>características de nuestro material PLA aquí<\/strong><\/a><\/p><p><a href=\"\/collections\/pla\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Filamentos PLA ✔️\"><strong>Comprar Filamentos PLA de Calidad aquí<\/strong><\/a><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16024497193117__39a6a8b2-c285-440e-a2b9-6ff9f01941bc-1675270065a460700c-0","template--16024497193117__39a6a8b2-c285-440e-a2b9-6ff9f01941bc-1675270065a460700c-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Filamentos_Print3x.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":0}},"af179b82-3844-43cb-903b-8b2a9824cab6":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16024497193117__af179b82-3844-43cb-903b-8b2a9824cab6-1675270065a460700c-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Historia","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16024497193117__af179b82-3844-43cb-903b-8b2a9824cab6-1675270065a460700c-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Un día estaba haciendo una demostración de nuestra anterior impresora, la minerva, un modelo descontinuado, y la base era de vidrio y ocupábamos laca para que las piezas se peguen. Para despegarlas ocupábamos una <strong>espátula delgada<\/strong> y costo tanto despegarla que al ocupar fuerza, despega la pieza y <strong>me entierro<\/strong> la punta de la espátula en la mano, y corrió un pequeño hilo de sangre, en frente de los niños del colegio. <\/p><p>Desde ahí que buscábamos una solución para hacer el despegue más fácil, 2 años después, <strong>Padi<\/strong>.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16024497193117__af179b82-3844-43cb-903b-8b2a9824cab6-1675270065a460700c-0","template--16024497193117__af179b82-3844-43cb-903b-8b2a9824cab6-1675270065a460700c-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/226_-_Ligera2.png","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","image_behavior":"none","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":20,"padding_bottom":20}},"newsletter":{"type":"newsletter","disabled":true,"blocks":{"heading":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Únete al mundo de los alquimistas 3D","heading_size":"h1"}},"paragraph":{"type":"paragraph","settings":{"text":"<p>y conquista la transmutación de piezas 3D<\/p>"}},"email-form":{"type":"email_form","settings":{}}},"block_order":["heading","paragraph","email-form"],"settings":{"color_scheme":"accent-2","full_width":true,"padding_top":44,"padding_bottom":44}}},"order":["main","loox-product-reviews-app-section","related-products","collapsible-content","a04870e8-ac7e-4376-ba28-693e26790a32","8849eaaa-f0e0-4cbe-9fa1-97396f9900d2","3dac2969-ba90-4798-9499-5448efff0943","82466e86-4b5e-4d4d-b6f5-0e9a3bc237f7","1eb23780-e720-4f35-a5f0-1005998fc305","92cf025b-d380-4f61-b2ec-9108e7a424f0","b0a17910-7984-481b-9484-645bdd45506a","39a6a8b2-c285-440e-a2b9-6ff9f01941bc","af179b82-3844-43cb-903b-8b2a9824cab6","newsletter"]}